Alias[GG_LC]: ((LIFE>24 STAT329>2) OR (FRW>0 STAT329>2) OR (FHR>0 STAT329>2) OR (LIFE>24 STAT330>2) OR (FRW>0 STAT330>2) OR (FHR>0 STAT330>2) OR (LIFE>24 STAT331>2) OR (FRW>0 STAT331>2) OR (FHR>0 STAT331>2) OR (LIFE>24 STAT332>2) OR (FRW>0 STAT332>2) OR (FHR>0 STAT332>2) OR (LIFE>24 STAT357>2) OR (FRW>0 STAT357>2) OR (FHR>0 STAT357>2) OR (LIFE>24 IAS>5) OR (FRW>0 IAS>5) OR (FHR>0 IAS>5) OR (LIFE>24 FCR>5) OR (FRW>0 FCR>5) OR (FHR>0 FCR>5) OR STAT329>2 OR STAT330>2 OR STAT331>2 OR STAT332>2 OR STAT357>2 OR IAS>6 OR FCR>5)
